// Into flooded pumpworks by the east service door and over the pump wheel by rope gun (no wall climbing: see
// site_pumpworks_traverse.scn), down onto the timber landing on the viewing window's sill (keyed into the wheel's
// rim), S at the rope ladder's head on its west end, 7 m down it to the dry hall floor and the chest, unhurt.
map
